# Copy to http_token_auth.txt (gitignored). One line per accepted bearer token: the token's
# HMAC-SHA256 keyed with ACME_SECURITY_SECRET, never the token itself. Generate lines with
#   cd pi && python3 -m onem2m.make_token --secret <ACME_SECURITY_SECRET>
# Typically two: this Pi's AE (ONEM2M_TOKEN in pi/.env) and the HydroOS app.
